120: - Storefront Products Landing Page ([page.tsx](file:///d:/Aakash/E-Commerce/src/app/(store)/products/page.tsx)) automatically parses comma-separated spec values, discovering and populating all individual options as interactive checkboxes inside the top secondary filter bar!
121: 
122: ### 18. Combo Products & Frequently Bought Together Feature
123: - **Admin Dashboard Products Management** ([page.tsx](file:///d:/Aakash/E-Commerce/src/app/(admin)/admin/products/page.tsx)):
124:   - Replaced the action button with a native **Radix UI Sliding Toggle Switch Knob (`<Switch />`)** component alongside a dynamic status badge (`Available` vs `Disabled`) for `Combo Deals Status`.
125:   - Added support for **Multiple Combo Offer Packages (Max 3 Combos)**: store managers can create up to 3 distinct combo packages (e.g. `Combo Offer 1`, `Combo Offer 2`, `Combo Offer 3`).
126:   - Enforced a strict limit of **Max 2 bundled products per combo offer** with real-time UI feedback (`Max 2 Items Added`).
127:   - Features **Category** and **Sub-Category** dropdown filters to easily discover and add products to each combo offer.
128: - **Storefront Product Detail Page** ([page.tsx](file:///d:/Aakash/E-Commerce/src/app/(store)/products/[id]/page.tsx)):
129:   - Respects `comboAvailable` status (hides combo section if disabled).
130:   - Renders top **Combo Offer Pill Tabs** when multiple combo packages exist, allowing customers to switch between different combo packages (e.g. "Combo Offer 1: Earbuds Pack" vs "Combo Offer 2: Smartwatch Bundle").
131:   - Displays main product + up to 2 bundled combo items connected with `+` separators.
132:   - Interactive checkboxes with real-time recalculation of total bundle price and savings!
133:   - Single-click **"Add both to Cart"** / **"Add all X to Cart"** button that populates the cart in one step with instant toast notification!
134: 
